    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WDA201 · Assessment 1/4</span>\n<h2>Class Participation and Preparation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14060 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WDA201 · Đầu điểm 1/4</span>\n<h2>Class Participation and Preparation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14060 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Participation grade will be given based on students' attendance, students' attitude, preparation, contribution of discussions</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 40 — Individual Assignment 2: In class</li><li>Session 41 — Individual Assignment 2: In class</li><li>Session 42 — Individual Assignment 2: In class</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 40 — Individual Assignment 2: In class</li><li>Buổi 41 — Individual Assignment 2: In class</li><li>Buổi 42 — Individual Assignment 2: In class</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
